 "intro_zh": "嵩山少林风景区位于河南省登封市境内，除了巍峨耸立的嵩山，景区还有始建于北魏的少林寺、规模宏大的中岳庙、程朱理学发源地嵩阳书院等古迹。其中，少林寺有“天下第一名刹”的美誉，现存建筑包括常住院、塔林、初祖庵、二祖庵及达摩洞等。2007年8月17日，嵩山少林风景区入选首批国家5A级景区。",
 "intro_en": "Songshan Shaolin Scenic Area is located in Dengfeng City, Henan Province. In addition to the towering Songshan Mountain, the scenic area also has Shaolin Temple built in the Northern Wei Dynasty, the large-scale Zhongyue Temple, and Songyang Academy, the birthplace of Cheng-Zhu Neo-Confucianism. Among them, Shaolin Temple has the reputation of \"the most famous temple in the world\". The existing buildings include the Chang'an Hospital, Pagoda Forest, First Ancestor's Temple, Second Ancestor's Temple and Bodhidharma Cave. On August 17, 2007, Songshan Shaolin Scenic Area was selected into the first batch of national 5A-level scenic spots.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
